            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Berth 1.1.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Dropping a file on an app in the dock now opens it with that app, as in Apple's Dock. If the app cannot open the file nothing happens; hold Command to force it.</li>
<li>Holding a file over an app in the dock for two seconds brings that app forward, so you can drop the file into its window.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
