        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:33:49 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Berth 1.1.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>A new right-click menu, drawn in your Dock's own look and anchored above the icon. It works from the keyboard too, and Option switches Quit to Force Quit.</li>
<li>Actions for each app: new and private windows in browsers, opening a window with a specific browser profile, New Window in Finder and Terminal, and play/pause, previous and next for Spotify and Music with the current track.</li>
<li>The menu on empty Dock space now lists presets inline, next to Settings.</li>
<li>The Trash icon updates as soon as something is moved to it or it is emptied from Finder.</li>
<li>Settings show the app version.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
